## Usage Examples

### Basic Compression:
```bash
./antman/antman file.txt 1 > compressed.data
./giantman/giantman compressed.data 1 > restored.txt
```

### File Type Support:
```bash
./antman/antman lyrics.txt 1    # Song lyrics compression
./antman/antman page.html 2     # HTML compression  
./antman/antman image.ppm 3     # PPM image compression
```

## Performance Characteristics
- **Time Complexity**: O(n) for single-pass compression
- **Space Complexity**: O(d + n) where d = dictionary size, n = file size
- **Compression Ratio**: Varies by repetition factor (better with more duplicates)
- **Memory Usage**: Constant overhead with dynamic scaling

